# Full-transcript row dumps carry third-party names + dialogue (PII) — kept local only,
# scrubbed from git in the 2026-09-26 un-leak. Regenerate via the census/probe scripts.

# Local-only golden evidence (un-leak 2026-09-26). Bright line: NOTHING meeting-derived
# — real, sanitized, or synthetic — enters the repo. Ear-truth fixtures, voiceprint
# embeddings, synthetic twins, probe manifests, the WHOLE exploration evidence dir, and
# the archived attestation records all count. Files live in MEETILY_LOCAL_EVIDENCE_DIR
# (default ../meetily-flash-local-evidence/, where they are backed up) once the §6
# migrations land; until then they sit untracked at these legacy paths. The pre-push
# guard (.githooks/pre-push) blocks outgoing commits touching them.
frontend/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/ear_truth_*.json
frontend/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/check_clips_*.json
frontend/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/engine_synthetic_*.json
frontend/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/nemo_c5_*.json
frontend/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/cde5c264_transcripts*
embed-probe-clips*.json
